<title>POLAND: Gdanski H1 net rises to PLN 55.34 mln.</title>
<headline>Gdanski H1 net rises to PLN 55.34 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Gdanski results for period ending June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						 H1 1996     H1 1995</p>
<p>    Operating profit			89.55  vs   94.20</p>
<p>    Pre-tax				   89.58  vs   94.20</p>
<p>    Net					 55.34  vs   47.13</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name Bank Gdanski SA.</p>
<p>    Profit on banking operations     196.78  vs  152.67</p>
<p>    Profit on financial operations     6.98  vs   -4.58</p>
<p>    Revenues from securities	     1.13  vs    0.00</p>
<p>    Revenues from commission	    37.03  vs   25.31</p>
<p>    Costs of commission		    2.05  vs    1.63</p>
<p>    Interest and similar revenues    361.35  vs  294.44</p>
<p>    Interest and similar costs	 212.35  vs  169.31</p>
<p>    Other operating revenues	     1.61  vs    1.69</p>
<p>    Other operating costs		  3.91  vs    2.52</p>
<p>    Income tax				34.23  vs   47.07</p>
<p>    Other taxes				0.00  vs    0.00</p>
<p>    Extraordinary profit		   0.03  vs    0.02</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
